From 24043763fdd11435ac7ae1437c5c0a68ed49723e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MrBoogus <90836807+MrBoogus@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:18:50 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] lf: add T5577 master suite, LF cloner lab, Hitag2
 decoder, RF scope, tuner, and PM5 control

- Add t5577_suite_page & t5577_crypto: full 7-mode T5577 workstation supporting
  EM4100 cloning with parity calculation, block reading/dumping, authenticated
  writes with password entry, SD dictionary brute-forcing, Atmel test-mode
  transient unbricking (r0..r3), and downlink password snooping.
- Add lf_lab_page: 5-mode high-voltage LF cloner (EM410x read/clone, HID Prox
  read/clone, Block 0 reset) and Flipper .rfid file saving.
- In read_hitag2_page: add transponder chip identification for PCF 7936, 7946,
  7947, 7942/44, 7941, 7952, and 7961.
- Add rf_scope_page: real-time scrolling RF carrier oscilloscope (HF 13.56M,
  LF 125k, LF 134.8k) with peak voltage tracking and load drop detection.
- Add antenna_tune_page: full LF + HF antenna resonance sweep with graphical
  resonance curve plot and frequency divisor markers.
- Add pm5_control_page: interactive hardware controller for LF frequency banks,
  Q-factor toggle, coil LEDs, WS2812 RGB illumination, and power-save modes.
